[en.DECISION_C08_ASSASSINATE_GLADMANE]
Assassinate Gladmane

[en.DECISION_C08_ASSASSINATE_GLADMANE_desc]
Gladmane Group in Manehattan have been a major obstacle to our liberation efforts. So... Of course, it mustn’t seem to be related to us.

[zh.DECISION_C08_ASSASSINATE_GLADMANE]
刺杀乐善

[zh.DECISION_C08_ASSASSINATE_GLADMANE_desc]
乐善集团在马哈顿的不配合对我们的解放事业造成了很大的阻碍。所以... 当然，不能让这件事看起来和我们有关。
